#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:403
msgid "Enable dynamic overhang speeds"
msgstr "启用动态悬挑速度"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:408
msgid "This setting enables dynamic speed control on overhangs."
msgstr "此设置启用悬挑的动态速度控制。"

#. TRN PrintSettings : "Dynamic overhang speed"
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:412
msgid ""
"Overhang size is expressed as a percentage of overlap of the extrusion with "
"the previous layer: 100% would be full overlap (no overhang), while 0% "
"represents full overhang (floating extrusion, bridge). Speeds for overhang "
"sizes in between are calculated via linear interpolation. If set as "
"percentage, the speed is calculated over the external perimeter speed. Note "
"that the speeds generated to gcode will never exceed the max volumetric "
"speed value."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:421
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:487
msgid "speed for 0% overlap (bridge)"
msgstr "0%悬挑的速度（桥接）"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:434
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:500
msgid "speed for 25% overlap"
msgstr "25%悬挑的速度"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:447
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:513
msgid "speed for 50% overlap"
msgstr "50%悬挑的速度"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:460
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:526
msgid "speed for 75% overlap"
msgstr "75%悬挑的速度"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:472
msgid "Enable dynamic fan speeds"
msgstr "启用动态风扇速度"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:477
msgid "This setting enables dynamic fan speed control on overhangs."
msgstr "此设置可在悬挑上启用动态风扇速度控制。"

#. TRN FilamentSettings : "Dynamic fan speeds"
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:481
msgid ""
"Overhang size is expressed as a percentage of overlap of the extrusion with "
"the previous layer: 100% would be full overlap (no overhang), while 0% "
"represents full overhang (floating extrusion, bridge). Fan speeds for "
"overhang sizes in between are calculated via linear interpolation."
msgstr ""
"悬挑尺寸表示为拉伸与上一层重叠的百分比：100%表示完全重叠（无悬挑），而0%表示"
"完全悬挑（浮动拉伸、桥接）。介于两者之间的悬挑尺寸的风扇速度通过线性插值计"
"算。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:540
msgid "Brim width"
msgstr "裙边宽度"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:545
msgid ""
"The horizontal width of the brim that will be printed around each object on "
"the first layer. When raft is used, no brim is generated (use "
"raft_first_layer_expansion)."
msgstr ""
"边缘的水平宽度，将围绕第一层上的每个对象打印。使用筏板时，不会产生边缘（使用"
"筏板_第一层_扩展）。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:555
msgid "Brim type"
msgstr "裙边类型"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:560
msgid ""
"The places where the brim will be printed around each object on the first "
"layer."
msgstr "边缘将在第一层上的每个对象周围打印的位置。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:563
msgid "No brim"
msgstr "没有裙边"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:564
msgid "Outer brim only"
msgstr "仅外部裙边"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:565
msgid "Inner brim only"
msgstr "仅内部裙边"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:566
msgid "Outer and inner brim"
msgstr "内部和外部裙边"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:573
msgid "Brim separation gap"
msgstr "裙边分离间隙"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:578
msgid ""
"Offset of brim from the printed object. The offset is applied after the "
"elephant foot compensation."
msgstr "裙边与印刷品的偏移量。偏移在大象脚补偿后应用。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:629
msgid "Complete individual objects"
msgstr "完成单个对象"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:634
msgid ""
"When printing multiple objects or copies, this feature will complete each "
"object before moving onto next one (and starting it from its bottom layer). "
"This feature is useful to avoid the risk of ruined prints. Slic3r should "
"warn and prevent you from extruder collisions, but beware."
msgstr ""
"打印多个对象或副本时，此功能将完成每个对象，然后再移动到下一个对象（并从其底"
"层开始）。此功能可用于避免打印损坏的风险。Slic3r 应警告并防止挤出机碰撞，但要"
"小心。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:642
msgid "Enable auto cooling"
msgstr "启用自动冷却"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:648
msgid ""
"This flag enables the automatic cooling logic that adjusts print speed and "
"fan speed according to layer printing time."
msgstr "此标志启用自动冷却逻辑，可根据图层打印时间调整打印速度和风扇速度。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:654
msgid "Cooling slowdown logic"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:660
msgid ""
"Determines how the printer slows down layer printing when the minimum layer "
"time isn't reached. 'Consistent surface' first tries to preserve the print "
"speeds of the first two perimeters by slowing all other features. Only if "
"this isn't sufficient, it also slows down those first two perimeters. "
"'Uniform cooling' slows down all print features, including the first two "
"perimeters."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:670
msgid "Uniform cooling"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:673
msgid "Consistent surface"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:679
msgid "Perimeter transition distance"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:685
msgid ""
"Distance in millimeters before non-slowed perimeters where the original "
"unslowed print speed is restored. This reduces print quality issues when "
"transitioning from heavily slowed feature to fast perimeter printing."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:694
msgid "Cooling tube position"
msgstr "冷却管位置"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:698
msgid "Distance of the center-point of the cooling tube from the extruder tip."
msgstr "冷却管中心点与挤出机尖端的距离。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:705
msgid "Cooling tube length"
msgstr "冷却管长度"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:709
msgid "Length of the cooling tube to limit space for cooling moves inside it."
msgstr "冷却管的长度，以限制冷却管内部的冷却移动空间。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:721
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:4055
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesSLA.cpp:542
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesSLA.cpp:1043
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Config/ConfigItemExtruderSelection.cpp:74
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/PrintHost/PrintHostRepetier.cpp:71
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:722
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will be reset to after the role-"
"specific acceleration values are used (perimeter/infill). Set zero to "
"prevent resetting acceleration at all."
msgstr ""
"这是打印机在使用特定于角色的加速值（周长/填充）后将重置为的加速。设置零以防止"
"重置加速度。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:746
msgid "Disable fan for the first"
msgstr "禁用风扇在前"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:751
msgid ""
"You can set this to a positive value to disable fan at all during the first "
"layers, so that it does not make adhesion worse."
msgstr ""
"您可以将此值设置为正值，以便在初始图层期间完全禁用风扇，以免使粘附性恶化。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:753
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:2010
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:3014
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:3424
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:3525
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:3848
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:3947
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:3968
msgid "layers"
msgstr "层"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:762
msgid "Don't support bridges"
msgstr "不支持桥接"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:767
msgid ""
"Experimental option for preventing support material from being generated "
"under bridged areas."
msgstr "防止在桥接区域下生成支撑材料的实验选项。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:787
msgid ""
"This end procedure is inserted at the end of the output file. Note that you "
"can use placeholder variables for all PrusaSlicer settings."
msgstr ""
"此结束过程插入到输出文件的末尾。请注意，您可以将占位符变量用于所有 "
"PrusaSlicer 设置。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:808
msgid ""
"This end procedure is inserted at the end of the output file, before the "
"printer end gcode (and before any toolchange from this filament in case of "
"multimaterial printers). Note that you can use placeholder variables for all "
"PrusaSlicer settings. If you have multiple extruders, the gcode is processed "
"in extruder order."
msgstr ""
"此结束过程插入输出文件的末尾、打印机结束 G-Code 之前（以及多材料打印机情况下"
"从该耗材换出任何工具之前）。请注意，您可以将占位符变量用于所有 PrusaSlicer 设"
"置。如果您有多个挤出机，则按挤出机顺序处理 G-Code。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:820
msgid "Ensure vertical shell thickness"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:825
msgid ""
"Add solid infill near sloping surfaces to guarantee the vertical shell "
"thickness (top+bottom solid layers)."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:830
msgid "Partial"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:831
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:2902
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:3442
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:837
msgid "Top fill pattern"
msgstr "顶部填充模式"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:842
msgid ""
"Fill pattern for top infill. This only affects the top visible layer, and "
"not its adjacent solid shells."
msgstr "填充顶部填充的模式。这仅影响顶部可见图层，而不影响其相邻的实体壳。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:848
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:871
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1586
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:4036
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:4056
msgid "Rectilinear"
msgstr "直线"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:849
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:872
msgid "Monotonic"
msgstr "单调的"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:850
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:873
msgid "Monotonic Lines"
msgstr "单调线条"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:851
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:874
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1587
msgid "Aligned Rectilinear"
msgstr "直线排列"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:852
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:875
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1593
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:4057
msgid "Concentric"
msgstr "回环"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:853
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:876
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1597
msgid "Hilbert Curve"
msgstr "希尔伯特曲线"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:854
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:877
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1598
msgid "Archimedean Chords"
msgstr "阿基米德和弦"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:855
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:878
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1599
msgid "Octagram Spiral"
msgstr "八角螺旋"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:861
msgid "Bottom fill pattern"
msgstr "底部填充模式"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:866
msgid ""
"Fill pattern for bottom infill. This only affects the bottom external "
"visible layer, and not its adjacent solid shells."
msgstr "填充底部填充的模式。这仅影响底部外部可见图层，而不影响其相邻的实体壳。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:884
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:900
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:2798
msgid "External perimeters"
msgstr "外部轮廓"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:889
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for external "
"perimeters. If left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, "
"otherwise 1.125 x nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as percentage "
"(for example 200%), it will be computed over nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:905
msgid ""
"This separate setting will affect the speed of external perimeters (the "
"visible ones). If expressed as percentage (for example: 80%) it will be "
"calculated on the perimeters speed setting above. Set to zero for auto."
msgstr ""
"此单独的设置将影响外部轮廓（可见轮廓）的速度。如果以百分比表示（例如：80%）它"
"将在上述周界速度设置上计算。为自动设置为零。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:915
msgid "External perimeters first"
msgstr "首先打印外部轮廓"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:920
msgid ""
"Print contour perimeters from the outermost one to the innermost one instead "
"of the default inverse order."
msgstr "将轮廓周长从最外层的轮廓打印到最里面的轮廓，而不是默认的反向顺序。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:927
msgid "Extra perimeters if needed"
msgstr "如果需要，打印额外轮廓"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:932
#, fuzzy, c-format, boost-format
msgid ""
"Add more perimeters when needed for avoiding gaps in sloping walls. Slic3r "
"keeps adding perimeters, until more than 70% of the loop immediately above "
"is supported."
msgstr ""
"在需要时添加更多轮廓,以避免倾斜的墙壁出现间隙，Slic3r 不断添加轮廓,直到支撑超"
"过 70% 的正上方循环。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:940
msgid "Extra perimeters on overhangs (Experimental)"
msgstr "悬挑上的额外周长（实验）"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:945
msgid ""
"Detect overhang areas where bridges cannot be anchored, and fill them with "
"extra perimeter paths. These paths are anchored to the nearby non-overhang "
"area when possible."
msgstr ""
"检测桥梁不能被锚定的悬空区域，用额外的周边路径来填补它们。在可能的情况下，这"
"些路径会被锚定在附近的非悬空区域。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:952
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/FdmViewerWrapper.cpp:733
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:134
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:151
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:169
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:181
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:202
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:614
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:634
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:678
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:707
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:724
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:745
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/PrintSettingsDialog.cpp:134
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/SidebarObject.cpp:273
#: src/slic3r-shared-wx/src/Slic3r/App/WX/BitmapGetters.cpp:131
msgid "Extruder"
msgstr "挤出机"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:955
msgid ""
"The extruder to use (unless more specific extruder settings are specified). "
"This value overrides perimeter and infill extruders, but not the support "
"extruders."
msgstr ""
"要使用的挤出机（除非指定了更具体的挤出机设置）。此值覆盖轮廓和填充挤出机，但"
"不覆盖支撑挤出机。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:972
msgid "Extruder offset"
msgstr "挤出机偏移"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:973
msgid ""
"If your firmware doesn't handle the extruder displacement you need the G-"
"code to take it into account. This option lets you specify the displacement "
"of each extruder with respect to the first one. It expects positive "
"coordinates (they will be subtracted from the XY coordinate)."
msgstr ""
"如果您的固件不处理挤出机位移位，则需要 G-Code 来考虑它。此选项允许您指定每个"
"挤出机相对于第一个挤出机的位移。需要填写正坐标（它们将从 XY 坐标中减去）。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:994
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Plater/SvgDialog.cpp:177
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Plater/TextDialog.cpp:91
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/FdmViewerWrapper.cpp:769
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/FdmViewerWrapper.cpp:979
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Types.cpp:90
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Types.cpp:93
msgid "Height"
msgstr "高度"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:995
msgid ""
"Only used when 'Print Settings -> Complete individual objects' is active. "
"Set this to the vertical distance between your nozzle tip and (usually) the "
"X carriage rods. Used to check for collisions with previously printed "
"objects and to prevent them when arranging.\n"
"The value is ignored for most Prusa printers, which come with more detailed "
"extruder model."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1009
msgid "Radius"
msgstr "半径"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1010
msgid ""
"Only used when 'Print Settings -> Complete individual objects' is active. "
"Set this to a radius of a nozzle-centered cylinder big enough to enclose the "
"extruder assembly. Used to check for collisions with previously printed "
"objects and to prevent them when arranging.\n"
"The value is ignored for most Prusa printers, which come with more detailed "
"extruder model."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1020
msgid "Extrusion multiplier"
msgstr "挤出乘数"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1025
msgid ""
"This factor changes the amount of flow proportionally. You may need to tweak "
"this setting to get nice surface finish and correct single wall widths. "
"Usual values are between 0.9 and 1.1. If you think you need to change this "
"more, check filament diameter and your firmware E steps."
msgstr ""
"此因子按比例更改流量。您可能需要调整此设置，以获得漂亮的表面光洁度和正确的单"
"壁宽度。通常值介于 0.9 和 1.1 之间。如果您认为需要更改更多，请检查耗材直径和"
"固件 E 步骤。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1035
msgid "Default extrusion width"
msgstr "默认挤出宽度"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1040
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to allow a manual extrusion width. If left to "
"zero, Slic3r derives extrusion widths from the nozzle diameter (see the "
"tooltips for perimeter extrusion width, infill extrusion width etc). If "
"expressed as percentage (for example: 230%), it will be computed over nozzle "
"diameter."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1052
msgid "Keep fan always on"
msgstr "始终保持风扇打开"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1057
msgid ""
"If this is enabled, fan will never be disabled and will be kept running at "
"least at its minimum speed. Useful for PLA, harmful for ABS."
msgstr ""
"如果启用此功能，风扇将永远不会被禁用，并且将保持至少以最低速度运行。对 PLA 有"
"用，对 ABS 有害。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1063
msgid "Enable fan if layer print time is below"
msgstr "启用风扇，如果图层打印时间低于"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1068
msgid ""
"If layer print time is estimated below this number of seconds, fan will be "
"enabled and its speed will be calculated by interpolating the minimum and "
"maximum speeds."
msgstr ""
"如果图层打印时间估计低于此秒数，则将启用风扇，并通过插值最小和最大速度来计算"
"其速度。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1070
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:3468
msgid "approximate seconds"
msgstr "近似秒"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1077
msgid "Filament change time"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1081
msgid ""
"Time required for a single filament change. On a printer with multiple tools "
"this is the time required for a single toolchange to take place. On a "
"printer with multi-material upgrade, this is the time required to unload and "
"load a new filament."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1087
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1218
