msgid "Bed custom texture"
msgstr "床自定义纹理"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigCommon.cpp:76
msgid "Bed custom model"
msgstr "床自定义模型"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigCommon.cpp:95
msgid "Elephant foot compensation"
msgstr "大象脚补偿"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigCommon.cpp:100
msgid ""
"The first layer will be shrunk in the XY plane by the configured value to "
"compensate for the 1st layer squish aka an Elephant Foot effect."
msgstr ""
"第一层将被相对于配置的值在 XY 平面上缩小, 以补偿第一层斜视, 也就是大象脚的效"
"果。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigCommon.cpp:109
msgid "G-code thumbnails"
msgstr "G-Code 缩略图"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigCommon.cpp:112
msgid "Thumbnails"
msgstr ""

